  "review_notes": [
    "The τῷ πρώτῳ unit is the main judgment call: rule 102 is unanimous that a Greek article governing a substantival adjective takes both the determiner and the supplied nominal, so man goes to the article and chief stands bare. Heading chief man on chief under rule 17's generic-noun clause was rejected because that clause is scoped to anarthrous Greek.",
    "The variant unit is underdetermined on the base reading and every projected token is realized."
